      "title": "Ebay and former execs to pay $55.7m after harassment campaign against journalists",
      "content_html": "<a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/07/28/ebay-and-former-execs-to-pay-55-7m-for-harassment-campaign-against-journalists.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Ebay and former execs to pay $55.7m after harassment campaign against journalists\"><img alt=\"An FBI photo of the pig mask mailed to the Steiners&#039; home\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"864\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ebay-pig-mask-1536x864-1785271315.jpeg?fit=1536%2C864&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;\" width=\"1536\" /></a><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If large corporations are supposed to prefer subtle and well-lawyered forms of misconduct, <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2024/01/11/ebay-fined-3-million-for-employees-who-sent-live-spiders-and-pig-fetus-to-critics.html\">no-one told Ebay,</a> whose global security team <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2020/06/15/six-members-of-ebays-global.html\">ended up facing criminal charges</a> over their <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EBay_stalking_scandal\">unhinged harassment campaign</a> against Ina and David Steiner, two journalists who criticized the company. &#8212; <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/07/28/ebay-and-former-execs-to-pay-55-7m-for-harassment-campaign-against-journalists.html\">Read the rest </a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/07/28/ebay-and-former-execs-to-pay-55-7m-for-harassment-campaign-against-journalists.html\">Ebay and former execs to pay $55.7m after harassment campaign against journalists</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://boingboing.net\">Boing Boing</a>.</p>",
